# --- AI Services (skk.moe/ai.conf 补充列表) ---
# 定位：补充 skk.moe/ai.conf 未覆盖的 AI 服务
# skk.moe 已覆盖: OpenAI/ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Grok, Perplexity,
#   Meta AI, xAI, Poe, Groq, Dify, OpenRouter, OpenArt, Jasper, ClipDrop 等
# 本列表专注: 桌面进程匹配、skk.moe 遗漏的域名、新兴 AI 服务
# 最后更新: 2026-07-22

# ====== 桌面应用进程匹配 (skk.moe 无此类规则) ======
PROCESS-NAME,"/Applications/Claude.app/"
PROCESS-NAME,"/Applications/Codex.app/"
PROCESS-NAME,"/Applications/ChatGPT.app/"
PROCESS-NAME,"/Applications/Cursor.app/"
PROCESS-NAME,"/Applications/Windsurf.app/"

# ====== OpenAI 补充 (skk.moe 未覆盖的辅助域名) ======
